            fb_r1_flood: `The legacy rules at a wide threshold flood the queue: most alerts are never read, and of those that are, four in five are honest customers. An alert nobody investigates detects nothing: it only delays a payment.`,
            fb_r1_size: `The threshold is not sized to what the team can investigate: either alerts go unread or capacity sits idle that could be finding fraud.`,
