            fb_r1_ok: `A tool that learns, a threshold sized to the team and a queue ranked by expected value: the unit investigates what matters.`,
            fb_r2_deny: `Refusing on suspicion what could not be investigated leaves honest customers without their money and with no evidence against them. That is not detection, and a court will not accept it.`,
